<h1>About Sarkari Tools</h1>

<p>
Sarkari Tools is a free online platform created by Dozni to help users complete government, competitive exam, recruitment, admission, and document-related tasks easily.
</p>

<p>
Our tools are designed to simplify common requirements such as adding name and date on photos, resizing images for exam uploads, merging photos and signatures, converting images to PDF, calculating age, and more.
</p>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>

<p>
Our mission is to provide fast, simple, secure, and accessible online tools for students, job seekers, and everyday internet users.
</p>

<h2>What We Provide</h2>

<ul>
<li>Government form utility tools</li>
<li>Image and document tools</li>
<li>Photo and signature processing tools</li>
<li>Free browser-based utilities</li>
<li>User-friendly tools without technical complexity</li>
</ul>

<h2>User Privacy</h2>

<p>
We focus on user privacy and security. Most tools process files directly in the browser whenever possible and we do not intentionally store personal uploaded files on our servers.
</p>

